(Penny:)whenever I would
take off my bra,

5
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:14,760
(Penny:)he would giggle and say,
"Oh, boy, my breast friends!"

6
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:17,000
(Bernadette:)Well, if it makes you
feel any better,

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,970
(Bernadette:)I'm never speaking
to Priya again.

8
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:20,040
(Penny:)No, don't do that.

9
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,590
(Penny:)No reason to be mean to her.

10
00:00:21,590 --> 00:00:25,010
(Amy:)This may be the
alcohol talking...

11
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:26,240
(Amy:)but I believe there is.

12
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:28,410
(Amy:)Are you familiar
with the recent study

13
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:30,850
(Amy:)of Tanzanian chimpanzees
