14
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:33,080
(Amy:)out of Kyoto University?

15
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:36,320
(Penny:)No, but I can name
all the Kardashians.

16
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:39,220
(Amy:)Primates, such as ourselves,
have a natural instinct

17
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,820
(Amy:)to ostracize ill-mannered
members of the troop.

18
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,160
(Amy:)Bernadette's urge to

19
