fling her waste at Priya

20
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,230
(Amy:)is hard-wired into her DNA.

21
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:52,130
(Bernadette:)I don't have an urge
to fling my waste.

22
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,470
(Amy:)Believe me, it's there,
we all have it.

23
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:57,640
(Amy:)Hit me with some more booze,
and I'll show you.

24
